  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in the comal vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the onions and cook until they are softened and lightly browned.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the beef and cook until it is browned on all sides.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, turmeric, paprika, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the rfissa spice mix and stir to combine.",
    "Add 2 cups of water to the comal vessel and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 1 1/2 hours, or until the beef is tender.",
    "Serve the rfissa hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs, if desired."
  ],
